   <string name="qingshui_features_prevent_leak_title">Prevent prompt leakage</string>
   <string name="qingshui_features_prevent_leak_desc">Enable upstream certificate pinning for chat requests only, blocking man-in-the-middle / proxies from intercepting and reading your prompts. The built-in model checks official pinned fingerprints; custom providers use trust-on-first-use (TOFU) and reject any later mismatch. When on, non-HTTPS chat requests are rejected. Note: if the endpoint itself is a relay, it is the destination and cannot be prevented from reading.</string>
