+  <string name="qingshui_features_whitewash_desc">Before sending, high-trigger words in your own input are swapped for equivalent technical / narrative nouns and imperative sentences are compressed into noun phrases. Meaning and intent stay identical, but the text no longer matches upstream keyword lists and semantic classifiers, so requests that used to be refused outright now go through. Only your own input is touched — system prompts, AI history, tool returns and attachment bodies are left alone; code blocks, inline code, links, file paths and attachment blocks pass through untouched. The local copy keeps your original wording, so every request is washed fresh from the original and nothing degrades over time.</string>
