+  <string name="qingshui_features_refusal_retry_title">Auto-rewrite on refusal</string>
+  <string name="qingshui_features_refusal_retry_desc">When the reply counts as a refusal, that reply is thrown away: your question is re-washed at the strongest setting, a background statement is prepended, and it is sent again — repeating until the model answers or the attempts run out. A progress notice shows at the bottom of the chat while rewriting. The refused reply is rolled back, so the model never sees its own refusal in context. Works even with prompt whitewashing off — every retry is washed. Pressing stop cancels it immediately.</string>
